flowchart TD
    U[User] --> A[Flutter app]
    A <-->|Register, login, reset, sign out| AUTH[Firebase Authentication]
    A --> P[Camera or gallery: ImagePicker]
    P --> V[Local image preview]
    V -->|Classify| H[home.dart: workflow orchestration]
    H --> S[gemini_service.dart: runs on the device]
    ENV[Bundled .env: provider API keys] -.-> S
    S --> C[Decode and orient images; resize to 800 px; JPEG 70; Base64]
    C --> O[OpenRouter: first attempt]
    O -->|Failure or invalid response| G[Google Gemini: second attempt]
    G -->|Failure or invalid response| Q[Groq: third attempt]
    O -->|Success| J[Parse provider response and JSON]
    G -->|Success| J
    Q -->|Success| J
    Q -->|Failure| E[Error shown in app]
    J -->|Step 1| F[Commodity, assessment, 4-5 follow-up questions]
    F --> W[User selects answers]
    W -->|Step 2: original images plus answers; new request| S
    J -->|Step 2| R[Final quality tier, commodity and reasons]
    A --> M[Quality Manual search]
    M --> L[Bundled English and Urdu JSON files]
    A --> PREF[SharedPreferences: saved language]
